    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Dashboard scope and data prerequisites",
      "description": "This dashboard intentionally separates raw logs from metrics and does not assume JSON-formatted logs.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Logs:** all Docker services discovered by Alloy are queried as plain text. **Backend metrics:** require Prometheus to scrape `/actuator/prometheus`. **PostgreSQL metrics:** require `postgres_exporter` (already configured in production). **Local limitation:** processes launched directly from a terminal are not Docker log sources; they must write to a tailed file, export logs through OTLP, or run in Docker."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
